## bool(): It is an inbuilt function, which helps to check the value is default or non-default
            ## If the value is default we get output as False
            ## If the value is non-default we get output as True
            
## Note: All the values other than default values are considered as non-default values
            
print(bool(0))
print(bool(1))          
print(bool(0.0))
print(bool(1.0))
print(bool(0j))
print(bool(1j))

